{"unit":5,"no":19,"title":"Right now or always?","blurb":"Unit 5","VOCAB":[["today","","сегодня","бүгін",""],["this week","","на этой неделе","осы аптада",""],["at the moment","","в данный момент","қазіргі сәтте",""],["right now","","прямо сейчас","дәл қазір",""],["these days","","в наши дни","қазіргі кезде",""],["usually","","обычно","әдетте",""],["normally","","как правило","қалыпты жағдайда",""],["every day","","каждый день","күн сайын",""],["know","","знать","білу",""],["want","","хотеть","қалау",""],["need","","нуждаться","қажет ету",""],["have (own)","","иметь","болу (менде бар)",""]],"SLIDES":[["🚶","I usually walk to work."]],"PICWORDS":["today","this week","at the moment","right now","these days","usually","normally","every day","know","want","need","have (own)"],"DEFS":[],"CTX":{},"COLLOC":{},"IMG":{},"NOTES":{},"TIMING":{},"tracks":{"5_6":"A1_L19_5_6.mp3","5_8":"A1_L19_5_8.mp3"},"SEGS":{"5_6":[3.41,null],"5_8":[5.42,null]},"html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Intro\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 1 &middot; Intro</div>\n      <h2>Right now or always?</h2>\n      <p>Choose the right present tense: what you usually do — and what is different today.</p>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"self\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>How to study</b> — about 25 minutes. Today is a pure grammar day: two tenses, side by side.</div><div>Headphones on for the listening tasks.</div><div>After each <b>Check answers</b>, read the note — that is your teacher.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"group\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>How this lesson works</b> — you work with a partner. Today is a pure grammar day: two tenses, side by side.</div><div>Say your answers out loud, and check after each task.</div><div>Listen to the recordings together.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"solo\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>How this lesson works</b> — you work with your teacher. Today is a pure grammar day: two tenses, side by side.</div><div>Say your answers out loud, and check after each task.</div><div>Listen to the recordings together.</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Warm-up\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 2 &middot; Warm-up</div>\n      <h2>Warm-up</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Usually — but not today?</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Tap everything that is different for you today.</p>\n      <div class=\"grid3\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><div class=\"card\"><b>☕</b> &nbsp;I usually drink tea, but today — coffee</div><div class=\"card\"><b>🚌</b> &nbsp;I usually walk, but today I'm taking the bus</div><div class=\"card\"><b>👔</b> &nbsp;I'm wearing something unusual</div><div class=\"card\"><b>🕐</b> &nbsp;I got up at a different time</div><div class=\"card\"><b>🍽️</b> &nbsp;lunch was different</div><div class=\"card\"><b>😴</b> &nbsp;I'm more tired than usual</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Words\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 3 &middot; Words</div>\n      <h2>Words</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"vbar\">\n        <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin:0\">Read the words. Click a card to see an example.</div>\n        <label class=\"switch\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"trToggle\"><span class=\"track\"></span><span>Show translation</span></label>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"words\" id=\"words\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">The time words that choose the tense for you.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Tap 🔊 to listen. Turn on translations only if you need them.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Recall\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 4 &middot; Recall</div>\n      <h2>Recall</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Which tense does each time word want?</div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l19s3t1\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">usually →\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Present Continuous</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Past Simple</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Present Simple</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">right now →\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Present Simple</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Present Continuous</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Past Simple</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">every day →\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Present Continuous</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Present Simple</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Past Simple</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">at the moment →\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Present Continuous</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Present Simple</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Past Simple</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">never →\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Present Continuous</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Past Simple</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Present Simple</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">these days →\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Present Simple</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Past Simple</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Present Continuous</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>usually / every day / never → Simple. right now / at the moment / these days → Continuous.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Grammar\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 5 &middot; Grammar</div>\n      <h2>Grammar</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Two present tenses — one choice.</div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div>“I usually <b>walk</b> to work — but today I<b>'m taking</b> the bus.”</div><div>“He <b>wears</b> a suit every day. Today he <b>isn't wearing</b> one.”</div><div>“They <b>go</b> to tennis on Thursdays. They <b>aren't playing</b> today — it's raining.”</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><div class=\"blab\">Notice</div><p><span class=\"q\">Notice:</span> in each pair — which sentence is about <b>every day</b>, and which about <b>now / today</b>?</p></div>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:18px;overflow-x:auto\"><table class=\"gtable\"><tbody><tr><th></th><th>Present Simple — usually</th><th>Present Continuous — now</th></tr><tr><td>Positive</td><td class=\"pos\">I usually <b>walk</b> to work.</td><td>Today I<b>'m taking</b> the bus.</td></tr><tr><td>Negative</td><td>He <b>doesn't wear</b> a suit.</td><td>He <b>isn't wearing</b> a suit today.</td></tr><tr><td>Question</td><td><b>Do you drink</b> coffee?</td><td><b>Are you drinking</b> coffee right now?</td></tr><tr><td>Time words</td><td>usually · normally · every day · never</td><td>now · right now · at the moment · today · these days</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>Present Simple</b> = your normal life: habits, routines, facts.</div><div><b>Present Continuous</b> = this moment, this period: now, today, these days.</div><div>Some verbs describe states, not actions — <b>know, like, love, want, need, have (own)</b> — they stay in the Simple: “I <b>know</b>” (never “I'm knowing”).</div><div>The magic sentence: “I usually…, but today I'm…”</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Choose\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 6 &middot; Choose</div>\n      <h2>Choose</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Choose the correct form.</div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l19s5t1\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">I usually ___ tea, but today I ___ coffee.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">'m drinking / drink</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">drink / drink</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">drink / 'm drinking</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">She ___ a suit every day.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">is wearing</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">wears</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">are wearing</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Look! It ___!\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">snows</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">is snowing</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">are snowing</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">He normally ___ at seven, but this week he ___ at six.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">is getting up / gets up</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">gets up / gets up</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">gets up / is getting up</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">They never ___ in the rain.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">are playing</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">is playing</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">play</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">We ___ English a lot these days.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">study</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">is studying</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">are studying</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>usually / every day / never → Simple. today / look! / this week / these days → Continuous.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l19s5t2\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">I ___ the answer.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">am knowing</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">know</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">knows</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">She ___ a new phone. (own)\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">is having</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">has</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">are having</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">We ___ a bigger flat.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">need</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">are needing</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">is needing</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">He ___ black coffee.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">is liking</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">are liking</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">likes</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>know · have (own) · need · like — state verbs stay in the Present Simple.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Clinic\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 7 &middot; Clinic</div>\n      <h2>Clinic</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Each sentence has one mistake. Choose the correct sentence.</div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l19s6t1\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “I'm usually walking to work.”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">I usually walking to work.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">I usually walks to work.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">I usually walk to work.</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “Look! It rains!”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Look! It's raining!</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Look! It raining!</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Look! It've raining!</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “She's wanting a new coat.”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">She wanting a new coat.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">She wants a new coat.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">She wanting an new coat.</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “What do you do right now?”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">What you are doing right now?</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">What is you doing right now?</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">What are you doing right now?</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “He don't working today.”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">He doesn't working today.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">He don't working today.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">He isn't working today.</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>usually → Simple · Look! → Continuous · want = state verb · right now → are you doing · negative now → isn't working.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Listen\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 8 &middot; Listen</div>\n      <h2>Listen</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">You know these recordings. Now listen only for the tense.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Now — or usually? Choose for each sentence.</p>\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('5_6',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 5.6 — three sentences</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">1 Paul is wearing a suit. 2 Anita and Paul are having a meeting with their boss. 3 They aren't working today.</div></details>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l19s7t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">“Paul is wearing a suit.” — this is about…\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">now</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">every day</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">today</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">“They aren't working today.” — this is about…\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">their usual week</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">today</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">now</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>is wearing / aren't working today → the Continuous → NOW.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('5_8',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 5.8 — the phone call</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">L: Hello? M: Where are you? L: I'm in a clothes shop. Why? M: What are you doing? L: I'm buying clothes, of course. M: I'm trying to cook a meal for six people, and the kids are making a lot of noise and the dog's running around… L: Why are the kids there? They go to tennis practice on Thursdays. M: Not today because it's raining. They never play in the rain. L: OK, I'm paying now. I'll be back in an hour.</div></details>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l19s7t6\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">“I'm buying clothes.” —\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">usually</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">yesterday</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">now</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">“They go to tennis practice on Thursdays.” —\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">now</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">yesterday</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">usually</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">“They never play in the rain.” —\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">now</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">yesterday (the past)</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">usually (a habit)</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">“It's raining.” —\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">now</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">usually</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">yesterday</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>-ing forms → now. go / never play (on Thursdays) → the usual routine.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Write\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 9 &middot; Write</div>\n      <h2>Write</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"self\">Write about your normal day vs this exact moment.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"self\">5–6 sentences. Use both tenses and one state verb.</p>\n      <div class=\"bubble cy\" style=\"margin-top:20px\" data-only=\"self\"><div class=\"blab\">Useful language</div><ul><li>I usually… but today I'm…</li><li>Normally I… These days I'm…</li><li>Right now I'm…</li><li>I never…</li><li>I know / want / need…</li><li>Look! …</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"group\">Interview your partner — their normal life vs right now.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"group\">Four questions each. Then report to another pair.</p>\n      <div class=\"bubble cy\" style=\"margin-top:20px\" data-only=\"group\"><div class=\"blab\">Useful language</div><ul><li>What do you usually…?</li><li>How often do you…?</li><li>What are you … right now?</li><li>I usually…, but today I'm…</li><li>He never…</li><li>She's wearing…</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"solo\">Interview your teacher — their normal life vs right now.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"solo\">Four questions each. Then report to your teacher.</p>\n      <div class=\"bubble cy\" style=\"margin-top:20px\" data-only=\"solo\"><div class=\"blab\">Useful language</div><ul><li>What do you usually…?</li><li>How often do you…?</li><li>What are you … right now?</li><li>I usually…, but today I'm…</li><li>He never…</li><li>She's wearing…</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"group\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>Step 1</b> — ask two Present Simple questions: “What time do you usually get up? How often do you cook?”</div><div><b>Step 2</b> — ask two Present Continuous questions: “What are you wearing today? What are you thinking about right now?”</div><div><b>Step 3</b> — report to another pair, one sentence in each tense: “She usually gets up at seven — but today she's sleeping until ten!”</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"solo\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>Step 1</b> — ask two Present Simple questions: “What time do you usually get up? How often do you cook?”</div><div><b>Step 2</b> — ask two Present Continuous questions: “What are you wearing today? What are you thinking about right now?”</div><div><b>Step 3</b> — report to your teacher, one sentence in each tense: “She usually gets up at seven — but today she's sleeping until ten!”</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Type it\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 10 &middot; Type it</div>\n      <h2>Type it</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Now produce it — type, don’t tap.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Spelling counts. Type the answers, then check.</p>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l19s9t1\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">Right now I ___ reading a great book.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"am\" placeholder=\"Type the missing word…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">She ___ the bus every day. (take)<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"takes\" placeholder=\"Type the missing word…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">I ___ drink coffee, but today I'm drinking tea.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"usually\" placeholder=\"Type the missing word…\"></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>Every day \\u2192 Present Simple \\u00b7 now/today \\u2192 Present Continuous \\u00b7 know/like/want stay Simple.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l19s9t2\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">I am knowing the answer.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"I know the answer.\" placeholder=\"Type the whole correct sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">She is work now.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"She is working now.|She's working now.\" placeholder=\"Type the whole correct sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Look! He plays football.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Look! He is playing football.|Look! He's playing football.\" placeholder=\"Type the whole correct sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>Every day \\u2192 Present Simple \\u00b7 now/today \\u2192 Present Continuous \\u00b7 know/like/want stay Simple.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l19s9t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">Say it about TODAY: I drink tea every day. (coffee)<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Today I am drinking coffee.|I am drinking coffee today.|I'm drinking coffee today.\" placeholder=\"Type the new sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">Say the habit: She is walking to work this week. (usually / bus)<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"She usually takes the bus.\" placeholder=\"Type the new sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Make a question: You are wearing my jacket.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Are you wearing my jacket?\" placeholder=\"Type the new sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>Every day \\u2192 Present Simple \\u00b7 now/today \\u2192 Present Continuous \\u00b7 know/like/want stay Simple.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Done\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 11 &middot; Done</div>\n      <h2>Done</h2>\n    </div>\n\n  </section>\n\n"}